// Deep River (trad. spiritual)

Tempo 70
Keysig F

Groove Metronome2-4
  z * 2
  
Repeat
Groove PopSpiritual
Volume m

1         F      /     F7
2        Bb
3       F/A      /     Bb    Bdim
4       F/C   A/C#     Dm

Groove PopSpiritualPlus
Begin Arpeggio
   Volume pp
   Harmony OpenBelow+16Below
   Articulate 200
End
Volume mf

5         F      /     F+
6        Bb
7        G9      /  Gm7/C     C7
8         F    Bb7      F   Fdim

Groove PopSpiritualSus
Volume m

9         F      /     Dm
10       Am
11       Bb      /     A7
12       Dm      /    Db7

Groove PopSpiritualSusPlus
Volume mp

13       G9      /  Gm7/C     C7
14        F    Bb7      F    Dm7

Groove PopSpiritualPlus
Volume p

15       G9      /  Gm7/C     C7

If Def FINISH
  Groove PopSpiritualEnd
  16  F / z!
  EOF
Endif

16      Bb7      F

Set FINISH

RepeatEnd

